        "function": "read_cookie",
        "input": "index from scanf(%llu)",
        "operation": "READ msg[index] via printf(%s, msg[index])",
        "risk": "HIGH",
        "reason": "Same signed comparison issue as edit_cookie. A negative index could read memory before msg[] as a pointer and dereference it with printf. Also, if the freed slot from eat_cookie is accessible, this reads freed heap content, potentially leaking heap metadata."
      },
